# Keep host/staged node_modules out of the build context so `npm ci` (Dockerfile)
# is the SOLE authority on dependency versions. A copied-in xchain-vm/node_modules
# would nest-shadow the hoisted, lockfile-pinned deps — notably the consensus-
# critical decimal.js arithmetic engine — making the version that actually runs
# in production ambiguous between validators. The whole fleet must run the same
# decimal.js (10.4.3) or contract math diverges and the chain forks.
node_modules
**/node_modules

# VCS / local cruft (do NOT add .env — Dockerfile's `COPY ./.en[v]` copies it on purpose)
.git
.gitignore
*.log
npm-debug.log*
